  "idea": "Excalidraw: virtual whiteboard for brainstorming and architecture diagrams",
  "text": "The hand-drawn style diagram tool that tech founders love. Presenting rigid, formal diagrams during early pitch stages makes ideas feel finished and discourages honest product feedback. High-fidelity mockups take hours to construct in complex vector editors, wasting valuable founder time before validating concepts. Excalidraw uses a casual sketch aesthetic that invites open collaboration and visualizes product architecture in minutes. You validate technical ideas much faster with investors.",
